Package: pathr
Title: Frictionless File Paths in R and RStudio
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Small tools that take the friction out of working with file
    paths on Windows. A keyboard-driven file browser that hands marked
    paths back to R, ready to read; a function and an addin that open a
    path in the system file explorer; and RStudio addins that turn pasted
    Windows paths, including a whole list copied from the file explorer,
    into valid R strings.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://dataniel.github.io/pathr, https://github.com/dataniel/pathr
BugReports: https://github.com/dataniel/pathr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en
